All green. Summary of the fix:

Root cause: src/agent_builder.rs called with_session_cap(...) and SESSION_TOOL_CALL_CAP (to wrap the sub_agent tool) but never imported them from tool_wrappers.

Changes:
1. `src/agent_builder.rs` — added `use crate::tool_wrappers::{with_session_cap, SESSION_TOOL_CALL_CAP};`. That resolved both E0425 errors.
2. **src/tool_wrappers.rs** — the SessionCapTool implementation existed but the task's required unit tests were missing. Added three tests reusing the existing MockTool/test_tool_context helpers:
   • test_session_cap_executes_below_cap — passthrough below the cap
   • test_session_cap_errors_past_cap — cap calls OK, cap+1 errors with "session cap reached", the cap number, and the tool name in the message
   • test_session_cap_independent_counters — exhausting web_search's counter doesn't affect sub_agent's
3. **`CLAUDE.md** — added SessionCapTool to the tool_wrappers.rs` bullet, per the task's docs requirement.

**Verified:** cargo build ✓, cargo test (4350 + 88 passed, incl. the 3 new tests) ✓, cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings ✓, cargo fmt -- --check ✓.
